d":"b-shiji-038","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-038-song"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:p031","text":"九年，大司馬孔父嘉妻好，出，道遇太宰華督，督說，目而觀之。督利孔父妻，乃使人宣言國中曰：「殤公即位十年耳，而十一戰，民苦不堪，皆孔父爲之，我且殺孔父以寧民。」是歲，魯弒其君隱公。十年，華督攻殺孔父，取其妻。殤公怒，遂弒殤公，而迎穆公子馮於鄭而立之，是爲莊公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m031-0003","start":3,"end":9,"surface":"大司馬孔父嘉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001429","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m031-0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"妻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001638","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m031-0016","start":16,"end":20,"surface":"太宰華督","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001427","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m031-0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"督","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001427","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m031-0029","start":29,"end":30,"surface":"督","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001427","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m031-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"孔父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001429","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m031-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"妻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001638","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m031-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"使人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、政制、群體、神異、匿名者或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代、制度爵等或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m031-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"殤公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001428","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m031-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"民","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、政制、群體、神異、匿名者或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代、制度爵等或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m031-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"孔父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001429","status":"contextual_provi